[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10321.75, "timestamp": "02:52:01", "text": "[音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10323.75, "timestamp": "02:52:03", "text": "嗯？所以必須換個人來。不過沒人想幫他們。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10332.23, "timestamp": "02:52:12", "text": "我還要繼續嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10343.22, "timestamp": "02:52:23", "text": "？我試試讓他掉下去。他沒掉下去。我漏掉了什麼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10345.71, "timestamp": "02:52:25", "text": "[音樂] 給我點提示。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10348.51, "timestamp": "02:52:28", "text": "好吧。行。我繼續做那個。嘿，酒吧在哪裡來著？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10366.11, "timestamp": "02:52:46", "text": "對，就是這兒。啊，但如果我進去就完事了，對吧？"}]